    "explanation": "Neither statsmodels nor pymer4/lme4 is available in the local offline virtual environment. In accordance with methodological safety guidelines, ordinary logistic regression is NOT substituted as GLMM because treating clustered block measures as independent would deflate standard errors and increase Type I error. The Task-Stratified CMH test serves as the verified, exact non-parametric equivalent that conditions directly on task difficulty strata.",
